From 7d66e0447b162871e867e13c34f6d6fce4000ab7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gustavo Morinaga <me@gustavomorinaga.dev>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 07:24:29 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] rsx: GPU copy for a target sampled while drawn into;
 texture uploads recorded into the Vulkan batch; constants staged in host
 memory; PS3_TRACE timeline

PS3_TRACE writes Chrome trace JSON with spans in the usleep, SPURS, FIFO,
texture and Vulkan paths. The engine's own-target read (colour correction)
takes a GPU copy of the target (color_snapshot) instead of a readback and a
re-decode; uploads stage in the batch ring instead of a buffer and a wait each.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
